  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Cba4Quu7YoVJSbTw7XmBiTY5WKueLGIhVNSFxxnRxmM.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$T_1 \\propto(R)^{3 / 2}$\nand $T_2 \\propto(1.03 R)^{3 / 2}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad T_2=(1.03 R)^{3 / 2} \\cdot T_1 \\approx 1.045 T_1$\nSo $T_2$ will larger by $4.5 \\%$ w.r.t. $T_1$.",
